<title>USA: Most U.S. debt futures finish quiet day higher.</title>
<headline>Most U.S. debt futures finish quiet day higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 11 - U.S. debt futures ended mostly higher after a quiet session. Traders were on hold before May retail sales data Thursday and Friday's producer price report. &quot;It was as quiet as can be,&quot; a trader said. Scant reaction to coupon pass, Sept T-bond holds very tight range.</p>
